silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorTypedClaim', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, TypedClaim is the third node in the R5 pipeline. For the Mittens fixture, the Witness object becomes the typed claim MeasurementEvent2024 carrying source=Mittens, quality=BodyMassQuality, value=4.1, unit=kg, date=2024-11-01. The typed sort enables the validate arrow but does not yet guarantee SHACL-shape compliance — the validate step has not run.." .
